  "description": "EPUFAY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C103 H74 Dy6 N28 O24 P2,8.5(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 5 O neighbors; Dy5 (Dy) has 6 O neighbors; Dy6 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.912-3.992 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 108.94-115.81°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Dy6(spch)6(O3PC10H7)2(pyra)2(MeOH)(H2O)]·8.5H2O (C103H91Dy6N28O32.5P2). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
